    "> Note: For paired-end data, we expect a report for both the forward (R1) and reverse (R2) reads of each sample. Since we have 12 paired-end samples, MultiQC should detect 24 FastQC reports.\n",
    "\n",
    "Let's list the output files that were generated:"
